	<key>readme</key>
	<string>## Usage

Show a grid of apps to open via the `launchpad` keyword.

![Keyword to show grid](images/about/keyword.png)

![Grid of apps](images/about/ui.png)

Type to filter, use the arrow keys to move and &lt;kbd&gt;↩&lt;/kbd&gt; to open. Rearranging apps is keyboard-based too.

Click the `?` in the search bar or press &lt;kbd&gt;⌘&lt;/kbd&gt;&lt;kbd&gt;?&lt;/kbd&gt; to view the cheat sheet.

Configure the [Hotkey](https://www.alfredapp.com/help/workflows/triggers/hotkey/) for faster triggering.</string>
